New proof target
----------------
Prove an admissible-smoothing lemma on HYP-2963 packet fibers: every primitive packet is either AP/GW boundary equality, a labelled Fejer interval certificate, a Ramanujan exact-period prime-power handoff, an off-resonance Kaczynski/Abel decay packet, a Freiman-reduced resonant finite atlas row, or a HYP-2908/THM-572 state-lift obligation.
